d:Meridian Relief Network, Nightwatch case, Depot 7. During the grid-instability night a cold-chain excursion directive went out to depot crews, telling them what to do with medicine that had broken the cold chain. A crew lead kept the copy they received, and something about it reads wrong.

<br>

The directive is a Word document (`.docx`). Work out how the version that reached the crews differs from what was actually approved, who changed it, and recover the original excursion authorization.

<br>

Everything you need is in the file.

<br>

